Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:18.37,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Futari Shizuka arranged \Na welcome party for Lady Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:20.14,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:23.34,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,In honor of a rare visitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.57,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,a toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.13,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,A toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.23,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,A toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.37,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,A toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:06.27,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(830,440)\fnArial\fs12\an1\i0\bord1\b1\shad1\blur2\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(605,310)}EP 6{\3c&H93CC2E&\4c&H93CC2E&\c&HFFFFFF&}\h\h\h\hFeast and Bonds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:10.86,Italics - Top,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Ah, the fragrance of crab and \Nthe sweetness of fresh sea urchin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:14.26,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,All punctuated with extravagant caviar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:16.39,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Is it to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:19.42,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,An impressive selection, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:22.08,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Of course. It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:24.15,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Yes, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.55,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,What do you think, Lady Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:33.63,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,This world's food culture \Nis also quite advanced!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:38.35,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,It's a feast for both the eye and \Nthe palate. It's truly exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.67,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:44.46,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,A pardon. May I ask what she said?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:47.65,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Lady Elsa also finds the feast delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:50.92,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Oh? How good that is to hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:54.07,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Feel free to eat your hearts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:56.61,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,But I must ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:06.37,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs14\bord1\fnArial\b1\3c&H343835&\pos(320,315)}*Do not feed meat to Java sparrows that aren't reincarnations of starsages!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:04.20,Main - Top,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Has your sparrow gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.37,Main - Top,Sasaki,0,0,0,,No, that's standard behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.86,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Delicious! Unmatched deliciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.96,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,The exceptional flavor of chateaubriand,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.84,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,enhanced by the perfect\Ndegree of char and salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:17.18,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,To present me such a delicacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:20.89,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,You are truly a force \Nto be reckoned with!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:24.74,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Is this what you finally \Nfound to praise me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.60,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Also, you've got sauce on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.88,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,S-So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.50,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,Is the meat really that delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:38.10,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Indeed. It is known as chateaubriand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:41.30,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,It's one of this world's treasures, \Non par with the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.51,0:03:52.07,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,It appears she has learned \Nof the forbidden flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:54.37,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,She will never return \Nto her life as it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:04:01.40,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,You dip things in this \Nchocolate fountain and eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.10,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:18.28,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,Th-That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:26.94,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Say, you must admit our partnership \Ncan lead to pleasant things, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:31.21,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Perhaps we might spare \Neach other more of our trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.42,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,What are you asking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:34.92,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,That curse of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:37.97,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,I'd like to have it removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.41,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,I will not oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:42.95,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Think back upon your past to see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:47.56,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,I see the sparrow still has it out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:51.31,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,What delicious yakitori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:53.49,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,This one's good too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.94,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,This {\i1}bird{\i0} is just so scrumptious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.99,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,You're going to make the curse worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:05.80,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:08.58,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Here, let Auntie peel your crab for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:11.35,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.04,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.21,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Chocolate crab?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:22.22,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Or maybe it could work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:27.31,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,A proxy war between angels and demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:29.52,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Truly an intriguing thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:32.73,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Either way, I am \Ngrateful to see you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.81,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Thank you, Peeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.66,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,May I ask what that is you're having?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:39.56,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Japanese sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.57,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,A kind of wine made from rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:42.70,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Would you like to try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:49.66,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Yes, this is quite fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.66,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,A clean taste with very little burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.46,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:58.25,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I like drinking with you like this. \NIt's a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:05.41,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,That's quite a handy trick \Nyou've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:08.14,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Though I've never used it \Nlike this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.10,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:13.31,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It's that time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:17.80,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I can't pass out drunk before \NI pay a visit to the other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:22.05,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,The internet is a truly grand thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:23.57,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Um, Peeps?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:27.48,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I was planning to visit \Nthe other world today...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:30.64,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Your pardon. \NCould you give me just a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:34.52,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,I am explaining to her \Nthe wonders of the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:37.62,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Um, okay, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:39.63,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,I will call you when we are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:40.71,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:46.77,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,The internet is not merely \Nfor the performing arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:48.97,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,One can view maps,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:50.39,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,purchase products...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:56.33,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,and post videos that one \Nhas recorded of oneself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.36,Italics - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.36,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,You can do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.48,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\3c&H1B1E10&\c&H2615CA&\pos(255,218.308)}I'm deeper in debt!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:03.32,Italics - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,I'm deeper in debt! What a dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.32,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\\shad0\3c&H1B1E10&\c&H2615CA&\pos(255,203.154)}What a dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:09.65,Italics - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,Is it okay for a guy 100 million yen\Nin debt to use public facilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.14,Italics - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,We're not allowed to drink\N park water, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:17.23,Italics - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,A guy with a 100-million debt \Ndoesn't have the right, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:07.03,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,Who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:11.03,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,He appears enraged over his growing debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.49,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,This poor man...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.81,0:07:13.90,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:17.23,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Would you like to record a video \Nto send to Julius in similar fashion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:19.71,Default,Elsa,0,0,0,,Yes, please! I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:23.55,Italics - Top,Guy,0,0,0,,Someone gimme some money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.71,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\3c&H1B1E10&\c&H2615CA&\pos(255.154,218.308)}Someone gimme some money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:28.24,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,That didn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:30.72,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I didn't want to interrupt the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:36.31,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,As you wish. I would be \Nhappy to entertain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:39.13,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate that very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:43.28,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,No problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.74,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Oh, she wants to get me drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:51.45,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,But Peeps said he'd call to me later...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:55.20,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Maybe it's all right to indulge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:03.75,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Now, I must know. \NIs fire all you can produce?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:06.72,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Well, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:09.78,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Could you water down my drink, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:12.83,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,C-Can't guarantee it's potable, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:21.08,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,That hits the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.27,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It sure does!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:24.29,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,On to the next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:25.23,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.58,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Very nice indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:34.74,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:37.08,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Okay, one more round!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.17,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:41.93,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It's fine. Peeps will wake me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.05,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It's fine because Peeps is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.59,0:08:49.85,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Peeps is here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:52.64,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Peeps is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:55.87,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,so cute! So it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:05.93,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Are you done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:10.49,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Surely, one more round...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.07,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,L-Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:20.07,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Can you truly afford to make \Nyourself defenseless in my presence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:25.66,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,One thing could lead to another...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:28.51,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.13,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:36.20,Default,Shizuka,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, are you falling asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:44.60,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:55.18,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Peeps! Peeps, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.41,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,F-Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:03.43,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,I foolishly lost myself in the wine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.54,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It's okay. The same happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:09.36,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,I truly am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:13.90,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Due to my failure, your precious \Nfree time has gone to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:18.80,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,No, I shouldn't have put \Neverything on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:21.71,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Now, about our next steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:27.00,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I decided to leave Futari Shizuka-san \Nand Lady Elsa in Peeps's care
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.65,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,and head to the bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:32.97,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I was also going to have to be sure\Nto visit the other world that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:39.79,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Sasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.66,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Good morning, Hoshizaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:47.34,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,I checked your work phone's location info.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:51.05,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Were you hanging around \Nmy school yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:54.44,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,U-Um... sort of?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.29,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,And may I ask why you'd do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:59.63,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:05.37,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Wait, why were you checking my location?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.88,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Th-That is immaterial!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:11.22,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Besides, I asked you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:14.95,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,I-Is it possible you were following m—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:14.95,Main - Top,Akutsu,0,0,0,,Morning, Sasaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:18.03,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:21.20,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I was just on my way to report in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.46,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Report in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:29.17,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I told him the bare minimum that \NI could about the prior day's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:32.88,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Obviously, I left my neighbor out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:36.77,Default,Akutsu,0,0,0,,The power to create an isolated space?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:42.40,Default,Akutsu,0,0,0,,First, I'd like you to submit \Nan official written report about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:45.96,Default,Akutsu,0,0,0,,We may need to change \Nour approach with this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.25,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:51.77,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.21,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,What were you about to say \Nearlier, Hoshizaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.45,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:59.57,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Right before he called us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:03.62,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,We can step into the conference\N room if you'd prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:08.86,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing! Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.28,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.84,Default,Hoshizaki,0,0,0,,Yes, it's really nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:15.54,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:20.75,Italics,Elsa,0,0,0,,Bye, Papa! Take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.87,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,To think you had such tools \Nat your disposal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:30.55,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I meant to bring this sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.65,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:38.36,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,To be honest, I drank \Na bit too much last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.11,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.78,Default,Peeps,0,0,0,,It was my own lapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:47.98,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,No, you've given me \Na glimpse of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:49.56,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,I could ask for nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:57.06,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,Sasaki-dono, could you record \Na similar "videoletter" of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:58.37,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Why, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:00.16,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'll get it set up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:04.30,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,No, I'll ask you another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:09.43,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,In truth, there is something \NI must tell you urgently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:25.55,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,The project request came in just \Ntwo months prior in this world's terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:30.96,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,My plan was to use it to remain holed up \Nin my domain for several years, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:40.81,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I suppose Marc-san is the one\Ndirecting things here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:44.86,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,Yes, he's been supervising \Nthe project as a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.14,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,However, he's been very busy of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:50.73,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,Someone else is acting \Nas the on-site foreman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.65,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:01.06,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.53,Default,French,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:05.49,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,French-san? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:08.04,Default,French,0,0,0,,You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.85,Default,French,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:14.08,Default,French,0,0,0,,an important construction project \Nwould begin in this region soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.01,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Th-That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:20.33,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,French-san does know Marc-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:22.26,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,so I'd mentioned it to him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:26.48,Default,French,0,0,0,,I wanted to be useful to you \Nafter everything that happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.82,Default,French,0,0,0,,so I found I just couldn't sit idly by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:31.92,Default,French,0,0,0,,And my sous chefs can run \Nthe restaurant themselves now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:34.27,Default,French,0,0,0,,so I decided to lend a hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:37.20,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,After French-dono started coming by,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:40.72,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,many of his regulars \Nbegan to offer aid as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.65,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Regulars?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.41,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Hey there, French-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.41,0:14:49.09,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,I heard Baron Sasaki was in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:50.16,Default,French,0,0,0,,You're all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:54.29,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Guess you must be the baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:58.49,Default,French,0,0,0,,H-Hang on a second. These are noblemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.49,0:14:59.88,Default,French,0,0,0,,You should show a little more—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:03.84,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,A pleasure to meet you. I'm Sasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:12.52,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Well? Nice worksite, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:15.11,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,We've got a real who's who \Nof artisans here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:23.14,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I've seen everyone at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:28.53,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'm truly grateful that you all \Ncame all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:32.05,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,And I look forward to seeing\N more of your handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:35.37,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,As you can see, I am a foreigner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:40.34,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Moreover, this land used to belong \Nto the subjects of the Herz Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:44.23,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It may presently be the Sasaki Barony,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:48.18,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,but I see myself \Nas simply renting your land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:51.26,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,A-Are you serious about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.55,0:15:52.78,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:56.18,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Plus, French-san is my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:16:02.69,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Anyone who keeps his company\Nis a welcome friend to me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:07.40,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,There's no need to stand on formality \Noutside of a public setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:12.98,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,If they think less of me, \Nthey might slow down with the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:15.73,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,French-san was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:18.15,Default,French,0,0,0,,D-Didn't I tell you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:20.52,Default,French,0,0,0,,He's a very generous man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.95,Default,French,0,0,0,,W-Wait, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:28.54,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Forgive us for being so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:30.05,Default,Worker A/B,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:35.31,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,I'm in construction,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:39.60,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,and I got to be friends with French-san \Nwhile visiting his restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:42.91,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Then one day, French-san said,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:47.86,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,"I'm going to help build a wall \Nfor the man I owe my life to."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:51.61,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,I was worried someone'd \Ntaken him for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:55.86,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,But I can see that's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:59.29,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Now we can fully devote \Nourselves to the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:02.49,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,N-No need to rush...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:09.01,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'll find a way to pay you, so I hope \Nyou'll take the time to see it done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.40,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:14.22,Default,Carpenter,0,0,0,,Baron Sasaki is truly a chivalrous soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:15.52,Default,Worker A,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.27,Default,Worker B,0,0,0,,Let's do a real good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:24.98,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have put you \Nthrough so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:26.93,Default,Marc,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:30.77,Default,Marc,0,0,0,,French-san and the others have been \Nso accommodating at the worksite...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.23,Default,Joseph,0,0,0,,My apologies for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:38.79,Default,Joseph,0,0,0,,Will this prove acceptable\N payment this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:45.88,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Could I earmark the full amount toward\N the budget for the construction site?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.07,0:17:48.84,Default,Joseph,0,0,0,,Are you certain about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.63,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'm putting so much on your plates,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:54.89,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,so I at least want to guarantee\N the finances are taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.44,Default,Marc,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:02.56,Default,Joseph,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll hold on\N to the full amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:05.53,Default,Marc,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Sasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:10.59,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,After concluding business with Joseph-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:13.05,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,we returned to Baytrium,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:17.34,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,only to find Count Müller had \Nmore urgent news for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:21.12,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Excuse... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:27.38,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,Sasaki-dono, this is Viscount Ohm, \Nhere on behalf of Duke Einhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:40.18,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,Duke Einhart acknowledges your efforts \Nin the construction of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:43.57,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,As the project's progenitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:48.02,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,he has decided, in his generosity, \Nto offer aid to your endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:53.19,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,As like-minded believers in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:56.23,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,of the Kingdom of Herz \Nunder Prince Adonis's reign,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:58.95,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,Duke Einhart hopes that his assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:03.94,Main - Top,Ohm,0,0,0,,will only encourage your \Ndevotion to our kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:01.77,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,First he pawns the job off onto me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:06.04,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,and now that it's going smoothly, \Nhe wants to take credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:11.25,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,Thus, I will be taking leadership \Nof the site personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.16,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,I have the workers all arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:19.55,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,I'll gather together the finest \Nartisans from my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:23.35,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,Your motley carpenters hardly qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.77,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,We'll give the work only to those
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:29.00,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,who have undergone \Na careful selection process.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:31.11,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,If that happens, they'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:36.74,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,I'll mobilize combat engineers \Nto aim for an even quicker completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:37.58,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,After all—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:39.13,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,If I may...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:43.41,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I must humbly decline your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.41,0:19:48.33,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:52.10,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I was charged with the trivial \Ntask of building a wall
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:55.05,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,on the border with the Ohgen Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:59.79,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It's hardly worthy \Nof Duke Einhart's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.14,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:05.73,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,You mean to defy the duke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:13.79,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,You believe the aid the duke is offering \Noutstrips what Kepler provides?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.01,0:20:19.07,Default,Ohm,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:23.79,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Joseph-san is a man of great influence. \NHis name will be useful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:28.00,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Even though the money's actually \Ncoming from me and Peeps...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.76,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.76,0:20:34.21,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I won't visit the capital until \Nconstruction of the wall is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:39.80,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'd like to request that Duke Einhart \Ntake the long view of our project.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.75,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Would you be willing \Nto pass on that message?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:53.00,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry to impose\N on you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.10,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:56.89,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,A relationship with \NDuke Einhart is important,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:20:59.17,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,but I believe you did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.53,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.53,0:21:05.13,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,By the way, there's one thing \NI wanted to warn you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:06.33,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:09.62,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,Well... How shall I say this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:14.14,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,The Lord Starsage \Ncannot hold his liquor at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:16.00,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:19.41,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,It may not be obvious \Nfrom his word or actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:21.56,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,but he can get most besotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:25.63,Default,Müller,0,0,0,,At times, he's even lost \Nall memory surrounding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:27.35,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:31.44,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,It's rare that I hear about Peeps's flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:37.11,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,The fact that he's usually hypercompetent \Nmakes it all the more charming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.37,Default,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Hello. Sasaki speak—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:51.46,Italics,Shizuka,0,0,0,,What has your sparrow done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.86,0:21:58.08,Italics,Sasaki,0,0,0,,My idyllic days had \Nonce again come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:03.55,Italics,Shizuka,0,0,0,,You people are seriously f*cked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.73,0:22:08.63,Italics,Shizuka,0,0,0,,You're f*cking f*cked!

